{"id":"bless-stone","name":{"en":"Bless Stone","ja":"恵みの石"},"desc":{"en":"A crystal with intrinsic medicinal properties. Adventurers suck on it like candy to maintain good health. Novice adventurers often end up with the runs.","ja":"天然の薬用成分が凝固した結晶。飴玉くらい の硬さで、熟練の冒険者はこれをそのままか じって健康を維持する。だが、初心者が真似 すると確実にお腹をこわすので注意。"},"level":4,"locations":[{"id":"arland-great-plains","name":{"en":"Arland Great Plains","ja":"アーランド南方大平原"}},{"id":"arland-area","name":{"en":"Arland Area","ja":"アーランド周辺地域"}},{"id":"runestone-nest","name":{"en":"Runestone Nest","ja":"魔石の巣"},"parent":"continental-coastline"}],"traits":{"id":"source-of-life","name":{"en":"Source of Life","ja":"生命の源"}},"categories":[{"id":"healing","name":{"en":"(Healing)","ja":"（薬品）"},"icon":"totori-category-healing"},{"id":"jewel","name":{"en":"(Jewel)","ja":"（宝石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-jewel"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":20}